@startuml
' drevops/behat-steps - data flow for the project's own test run.
' Traced from .ahoy.yml, scripts/provision.php,
' tests/behat/fixtures_drupal/d12/composer.json, behat.php,
' tests/behat/bootstrap/BehatCliTrait.php,
' tests/behat/bootstrap/BehatCliContext.php, scripts/merge-coverage.php.
' Regenerate every SVG with:  plantuml -tsvg docs/architecture/*.puml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
title Data flow: the fixture site and the nested Behat harness

participant "Developer or CI" as Dev
participant "scripts/provision.php" as Prov
participant "Fixture Drupal site\nbuild/" as Site
participant "Outer Behat run" as Behat
participant "BehatCliContext" as Cli
participant "Nested Behat subprocess" as Sub
participant "scripts/merge-coverage.php" as Merge

Dev -> Prov: ahoy build, which runs ahoy provision
activate Prov
Prov -> Prov: copy tests/behat/fixtures_drupal/d11 or d12\ninto build/, as DRUPAL_VERSION selects
Prov -> Prov: merge the library require + suggest\ninto the fixture composer.json
Prov -> Prov: drop the packages the selected Behat\nand Drupal majors cannot install
Prov -> Prov: composer update ~--with behat/behat:^3 or ^4,\nas BEHAT selects; the d12 fixture takes\ndrupal/core from source for core/tests
Prov -> Prov: on Drupal 12, widen core_version_requirement\nacross the installed contrib extensions
Prov -> Site: drush si standard, then copy tests/behat/fixtures/
activate Site
Site --> Prov: configuration imported, bootstrap successful
deactivate Site
Prov --> Dev: fixture site ready
deactivate Prov

Dev -> Behat: ahoy test-bdd-coverage:\nbehat -c /app/behat.php, run from build/
activate Behat

Behat -> Site: scenarios drive Drupal and Mink directly
activate Site
Site --> Behat: page and entity state
deactivate Site

Behat -> Cli: scenario tagged @test-trait:SomeTrait
activate Cli
Cli -> Cli: behatCliBeforeScenario reads the tag and writes a\nWebRawContext subclass composing only those traits
Cli -> Sub: spawn behat in a temp directory
activate Sub
Sub --> Cli: exit code, output, phpcov file
deactivate Sub
Cli --> Behat: assert on the subprocess output
deactivate Cli

Behat -> Behat: .logs/coverage/behat/phpcov.php
deactivate Behat

Dev -> Merge: then php scripts/merge-coverage.php
activate Merge
Merge -> Merge: fold every .logs/coverage/behat_cli/phpcov/*.php\ninto the main coverage
Merge --> Dev: .logs/coverage/behat_cli/cobertura.xml\nthe true total coverage
deactivate Merge
@enduml
